OL,3,GNEWSA'Successful year' as museum
OL,4,Avisitor numbers rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitor numbers to museums in Guernsey
OL,7,Fhave risen year-on-year, official
OL,8,Ffigures have shown.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said sites
OL,11,Foperated by Guernsey Museums had almost
OL,12,F66,000 visitors by the end of August,
OL,13,Fwhich it said represented a 3% increase
OL,14,Fcompared to the same period in 2025.
OL,16,FIt said events like the Castle Nights
OL,17,Fseries and Twilight Cinema held at
OL,18,FCastle Cornet over the summer also
OL,19,Fboosted figures with thousands of
OL,20,Fpeople attending.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
