OL,3,GNEWSA'Successful year' as museum
OL,4,Avisitor numbers rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Glencross, head of culture and
OL,7,Fheritage services at the States, said
OL,8,Fthe visitor numbers - which had since
OL,9,Fgone up to about 75,000 - showed the
OL,10,F"strong appeal" of Guernsey's history.
